OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car left dangling over sea
OL,4,Aafter pier crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police car has ploughed through the
OL,7,Frailings of a pier on the Isle Wight.
OL,9,FThe Hampshire & Isle of Constabulary
OL,10,Fcar went through the railings on Ryde
OL,11,FPier shortly before 10:10 BST. It has
OL,12,Fbeen left dangling over the edge of the
OL,13,Fpier.
OL,15,FThe force said the police car had
OL,16,Fcrashed with another vehicle and had
OL,17,Fbeen responding to an incident at the
OL,18,Ftime. It said no one had been injured.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
