OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car left dangling over sea
OL,4,Aafter pier crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters and police are at the
OL,7,Fscene with access to the pier closed
OL,8,Ffor both vehicles and pedestrians. The
OL,9,FWightlink Portsmouth Harbour to Ryde
OL,10,FPier Head FastCat service has also been
OL,11,Fsuspended.
